    {
      "label": "Body Copy",
      "required": true,
      "section": "top",
      "unit": null,
      "value": "The Spectrum LPW1600 is a compact, mains-electric pressure washer designed for the jobs most homes need to tackle two or three times a year \u2014 patios after winter, garden furniture in spring, the car at the weekend, the bins when they need it. 1600W of motor power, up to 130 bar of working pressure and a 420 L/hr flow rate give you proper cleaning performance without committing to a semi-professional machine.\nBuilt around quality components\nUnlike most washers in this price bracket, the LPW1600 uses a brass pump head and ceramic-coated pistons \u2014 engineering normally reserved for far pricier units. That's why we can stand behind it with a 5-year warranty (T&C's apply) where the supermarket alternatives offer one or two.\nEasy to move, easy to put away\nIntegrated wheels and a transport handle make it simple to wheel from shed to driveway. A rotating cord holder takes the frustration out of packing the cable away, and on-board storage keeps the lance, hose and connections tidy between jobs. At just 5.8kg the LPW1600 is genuinely portable \u2014 no two-person lifts, no hauling it up garage steps.\nVariable pressure across every job\nA pressure and flow-rate control lets you ease back for paintwork and rinsing, then crank up for moss-stripping and patio prep. The 5m steel-braided high-pressure hose and 5m mains cable give you a 10m working radius without extension leads. Maximum water inlet temperature is 50\u00b0C.\nWhy buy from MowDirect\n5-year Spectrum warranty (T&C's apply) \u2014 supported directly by us, not by a generic distributor\nUK stock, UK dispatch, UK after-sales\nSpare parts and service support available throughout the warranty period\nMain Image 1 *\n['UNSAFE_STRING_PREFIX_image_main_1']\nSecondary Image 1\nSecondary Image 2\nSecondary Image 3\nSecondary Image 4\nSecondary Image 5\nSecondary Image 6\nSecondary Image 7\nSecondary Image 8\nSafety Information Asset 1 - Digital Assets 01W\nSafety Information Asset 2 - Digital Assets 02W\nSafety Information Asset 3 - Digital Assets 03W\nSafety Information Asset 4 - Digital Assets 04W\nSafety Information Asset 5 - Digital Assets 05W\nProduct Identification 1\nProduct Identification 2\nProduct Identification 3\nVideo\nProduct Guide\nProduct Instruction Manual\nSafety Manual\nEU Warning_Safety Information\nDeclaration of Conformity\nSafety Test Report 1\nDeclaration of Identity\nSafety Test Report 2\nSafety Test Report 3",
      "api_name": "Body Copy"
    },
